@page "/"

<PageTitle>Scheduler</PageTitle>

<h1>Scheduler</h1>

<p>
    Find a meeting time across people and organizations without sharing calendars. The organizer proposes
    times that work for them; everyone else votes <em>preferred</em>, <em>if necessary</em> or <em>no</em>.
</p>

<p>
    Use it from any MCP-capable assistant by adding <code>/mcp</code> on this server as a connector, or from
    the voting link in your invitation email.
</p>
